# Neither the Dockerfile's `deps` stage (installs its own node_modules via
# `pnpm install`) nor its `builder` stage (generates its own .next via
# `next build`) needs these from the host — the host's copies were pure
# build-context waste on every single build (~753MB, mostly node_modules and
# .next; see curriculum/05-containers-and-the-local-platform.md §5 for the
# measured before/after).
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next

.git

*.log

# Never let a careless COPY ship a real local secret into an image layer —
# see curriculum/05-containers-and-the-local-platform.md §6.
.env
.env.*
